This licence covers the kit: the tools, scripts and documentation in this
repository. It says nothing about any game you point the kit at.

This repository contains no game code, no game data, and no BIOS. It never
will: everything derived from a disc is written into the git-ignored `context/`
directory. You supply your own disc image and your own BIOS dump, and what you
may lawfully do with them is a matter between you and the law where you live.
